:synohw_dx_level_plug:
> Used only with DX1215 fan mode MANUAL. The CPLD has exactly these three running levels; nothing exists between low and stop (measured, phase 2b), so low is as quiet as the DX1215 can run. The alarm, unreadable and 61 °C rules above still raise it.
:end

